---
title: Checkout
---
sequenceDiagram
  actor p1 as Customer
  participant p2 as Shop
  participant p3 as Payment
  participant p4 as Warehouse
  p1->>p2: Place order
  opt stock available
    p2->>p4: Reserve stock
    p4-->>p2: Stock reserved
  end
  alt payment accepted
    p2->>p3: Charge card
    p3-->>p2: Payment result
  else
    p2->>p4: Release stock
  end
  p2-->>p1: Order confirmed
